    "q-265980": {
      "dom_id": "step-q265980",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Consider the function $f:{R}^{2\\times 2}\\to R$ defined by \n\n$$\nf(X)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}{x}_{ij}^{2}\n$$\n\n \nwhere ${x}_{ij}$ are the corresponding matrix's entries. What is the gradient of $f$ with respect to $X$ at $X=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}]?$",
      "worked_solution": "The gradient of a function $f:{R}^{m\\times n}\\to R$ with respect to a matrix $X\\in {R}^{m\\times n}$ is\n\n$$\n{∇}_{X}f(X)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{11}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{12}} & ⋯ & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{1n}} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{21}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{22}} & ⋯ & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{2n}} \\\\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋱ & ⋮ \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{m1}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{m2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{mn}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIn our case, writing out the function $f(X)$ where $X=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{11} & {x}_{12} \\\\ {x}_{21} & {x}_{22}\\end{aligned}]\\in {R}^{2\\times 2}$, we get\n\n$$\nf(X)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}{x}_{ij}^{2}=({x}_{11}^{2}+{x}_{12}^{2}+{x}_{21}^{2}+{x}_{22}^{2}).\n$$\n\nSo, the gradient is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,{∇}_{X}f(X) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{11}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{12}} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{21}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{22}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{11}}({x}_{11}^{2}+{x}_{12}^{2}+{x}_{21}^{2}+{x}_{22}^{2}) & \\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{12}}({x}_{11}^{2}+{x}_{12}^{2}+{x}_{21}^{2}+{x}_{22}^{2}) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{21}}({x}_{11}^{2}+{x}_{12}^{2}+{x}_{21}^{2}+{x}_{22}^{2}) & \\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{22}}({x}_{11}^{2}+{x}_{12}^{2}+{x}_{21}^{2}+{x}_{22}^{2})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{11} & 2{x}_{12} \\\\ 2{x}_{21} & 2{x}_{22}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =2[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{11} & {x}_{12} \\\\ {x}_{21} & {x}_{22}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =2X.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $X=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}],$ we get\n\n$$\n{∇}_{X}f(X)=[\\begin{aligned}2\\cdot (1) & 2\\cdot (5) \\\\ 2\\cdot (-3) & 2\\cdot (4)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 10 \\\\ -6 & 8\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-265980-a",
